{"id":"f6aea2e756d32c1b","group":"73","path":"73/73-df-pda-configuration-space.md","title":"Pushdown-Automaton Configuration","display":"df-pushdown-configuration — Pushdown-Automaton Configuration","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-df-pda-configuration-space","aliases":["73-df-pda-configuration-space","73-df-pushdown-configuration"],"display":"df-pushdown-configuration — Pushdown-Automaton Configuration","depends_on":["[[73-df-pda-structure]]"],"source_id":"HMU2007","source_ref":"§11.2–11.3, print pp. 487–501; PDF pp. 509–523; local resource/coding interface","source_status":"third-edition-topic-mapped; inherited-local-review; not-a-line-by-line-source-proof-certificate","reviewed_on":"2026-10-24","legacy_source_id":"HU1979","legacy_source_ref":"§5.2, pp. 108–114; local finite-branch transition/configuration functions","legacy_source_status":"local-formalization; source-section-located; proof scope recorded in review","revision_round":"pdf-third-edition-20261024","edition_role":"third-edition-core","third_edition_chapter":11},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-df-pda-configuration-space"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-df-pda-configuration-space</span><span>73-df-pushdown-configuration</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-pushdown-configuration — Pushdown-Automaton Configuration"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3ded707d0dbfc1eb\" href=\"?note=3ded707d0dbfc1eb\" title=\"73-df-pda-structure\">73-df-pda-structure</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_id","html":"HMU2007"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"§11.2–11.3, print pp. 487–501; PDF pp. 509–523; local resource/coding interface"},{"key":"source_status","html":"third-edition-topic-mapped; inherited-local-review; not-a-line-by-line-source-proof-certificate"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"legacy_source_id","html":"HU1979"},{"key":"legacy_source_ref","html":"§5.2, pp. 108–114; local finite-branch transition/configuration functions"},{"key":"legacy_source_status","html":"local-formalization; source-section-located; proof scope recorded in review"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"third-edition-core"},{"key":"third_edition_chapter","html":"11"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,Z_0,F)\\in\\mathsf{PDA}_{\\Sigma}\">\\(M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,Z_0,F)\\in\\mathsf{PDA}_{\\Sigma}\\)</span> (pushdown automaton, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3ded707d0dbfc1eb\" href=\"?note=3ded707d0dbfc1eb\" title=\"73-df-pda-structure\">73-df-pda-structure</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q,w,\\gamma\">\\(q,w,\\gamma\\)</span> 是配置谓词的三个候选参数；成员式检验其状态、输入余词及栈词类型。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}pushdown\\text{-}configuration}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Conf}_M\\coloneqq Q\\times\\Sigma^*\\times\\Gamma^*\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}pushdown\\text{-}configuration}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Conf}_M\\coloneqq Q\\times\\Sigma^*\\times\\Gamma^*\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}pushdown\\text{-}configuration}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{PDAConf}_M(q,w,\\gamma)\\leftrightarrow\n(q,w,\\gamma)\\in\\operatorname{Conf}_M\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}pushdown\\text{-}configuration}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{PDAConf}_M(q,w,\\gamma)\\leftrightarrow\n(q,w,\\gamma)\\in\\operatorname{Conf}_M\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The three components are the current state, unread input, and stack word; the leftmost stack symbol is taken to be the top.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-pda-structure","status":"resolved","id":"3ded707d0dbfc1eb","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-pda-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-pda-structure","status":"resolved","id":"3ded707d0dbfc1eb","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,Z_0,F)\\in\\mathsf{PDA}_{\\Sigma}$ (pushdown automaton, see [[73-df-pda-structure]])","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,Z_0,F)\\in\\mathsf{PDA}_{\\Sigma}","display":false},{"tex":"q,w,\\gamma","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}pushdown\\text{-}configuration}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Conf}_M\\coloneqq Q\\times\\Sigma^*\\times\\Gamma^*","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}pushdown\\text{-}configuration}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{PDAConf}_M(q,w,\\gamma)\\leftrightarrow\n(q,w,\\gamma)\\in\\operatorname{Conf}_M","display":true}],"bytes":1686,"backlinks":[{"id":"c7b6c8f19d3f3fc8","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Conf}_M$ (configuration set, see [[73-df-pda-configuration-space]])"},{"id":"6af52783a9bce985","anchor":"ref-296","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-df-pda-configuration-space|Pushdown-Automaton Configuration]]"}],"outgoing":["3ded707d0dbfc1eb"]}